{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026MiaZ1i3Klj1791813517.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>教宗良十四世將於明日入院，準備做手術。</p><p></p><p>71歲的教宗，近日接受身體檢查期間，發現肺部有一處較細小，處於早期、尚未擴散的結節。</p><p></p><p>教廷表示，教宗將於當地周二上午入院，準備接受切除結節手術，預計手術後的住院時間為一星期左右。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:59:23.510537+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:42.167539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:42.167539+00:00","content_hash":"4576e37410beec172c7e893193691d4773f683dcd8c02ede53523e9e664480ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}